		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The insurance company will assess the damage and determine the compensation amount based on the declared value.</span></li>
		<li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>The insurance company will settle the claim and compensate you for the covered damages.</span></li>
	</ol>
	<p>By opting for a 100% declared-value marine transit insurance, you can have peace of mind knowing that your vehicle is fully protected throughout the entire transportation process. Additionally, this type of insurance ensures that you receive compensation for any damages, ensuring a hassle-free experience while transporting your vehicle from Faridabad to Okhla.</p>
